{"4489960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Forge: Steel Frontier", "steam_appid": 4489960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Development Version]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Forge</strong> is a stylized action RPG that puts visceral mech combat front and center.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of a mercenary walking the razor's edge between life and death, and venture deep into the frontier planet <strong>Dormant Dragon</strong>. Your journey takes you from the cold, high‑orbit command platforms down to the war‑scorched surface. Traverse the battlefield, crush formidable foes, upgrade your arsenal, and unravel the conspiracies buried beneath the endless conflict—all while carving out your own reason to survive as a lone wolf in an unforgiving galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boost &amp; Blade – Steel Splits the Sky</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/e494b90f5806930af1b4912fcb3721a9.poster.avif?t=1787571546\" width=852 height=478 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/e494b90f5806930af1b4912fcb3721a9.webm?t=1787571546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/e494b90f5806930af1b4912fcb3721a9.mp4?t=1787571546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bold aesthetics meet high‑octane choreography, delivering a combat experience that's as spectacular as it is stylish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Swords and Guns, Side by Side</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/ab671d3b4ed080f9274d9e6d457290a7.poster.avif?t=1787571546\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/ab671d3b4ed080f9274d9e6d457290a7.webm?t=1787571546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/ab671d3b4ed080f9274d9e6d457290a7.mp4?t=1787571546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth, responsive controls with visceral, hard‑hitting feedback.Grab unique weapon parts and action modules in the levels, customize your mecha to your liking, and take on tough enemies. Mix guns and blades to create your own combos—this might just be the most <i>distinctive </i>mecha action game you've ever played.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>React, Parry, and Punish</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/c99922eb85fc35721c3b66448f037f72.poster.avif?t=1787571546\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/c99922eb85fc35721c3b66448f037f72.webm?t=1787571546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/c99922eb85fc35721c3b66448f037f72.mp4?t=1787571546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/82c85e430f7de5b95a4a8979c087828d.poster.avif?t=1787571546\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/82c85e430f7de5b95a4a8979c087828d.webm?t=1787571546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/82c85e430f7de5b95a4a8979c087828d.mp4?t=1787571546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When facing attacks, dodge and weave, raise your shield to block, or take all of them down? Fight your way, your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various weapons and gear, mix and match freely</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/92d44b676f84e12a302d88b7fcfa0cd1.poster.avif?t=1787571546\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/92d44b676f84e12a302d88b7fcfa0cd1.webm?t=1787571546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/92d44b676f84e12a302d88b7fcfa0cd1.mp4?t=1787571546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely mix and match a range of weapons from heat dagger to heavy howitzers, and use them on different battlefields</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Even more weapon modules are in active development…)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Development Version]</h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Development Version]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Forge</strong> is a stylized action RPG that puts visceral mech combat front and center.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of a mercenary walking the razor's edge between life and death, and venture deep into the frontier planet <strong>Dormant Dragon</strong>. Your journey takes you from the cold, high‑orbit command platforms down to the war‑scorched surface. Traverse the battlefield, crush formidable foes, upgrade your arsenal, and unravel the conspiracies buried beneath the endless conflict—all while carving out your own reason to survive as a lone wolf in an unforgiving galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boost &amp; Blade – Steel Splits the Sky</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/e494b90f5806930af1b4912fcb3721a9.poster.avif?t=1787571546\" width=852 height=478 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/e494b90f5806930af1b4912fcb3721a9.webm?t=1787571546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/e494b90f5806930af1b4912fcb3721a9.mp4?t=1787571546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bold aesthetics meet high‑octane choreography, delivering a combat experience that's as spectacular as it is stylish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Swords and Guns, Side by Side</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/ab671d3b4ed080f9274d9e6d457290a7.poster.avif?t=1787571546\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/ab671d3b4ed080f9274d9e6d457290a7.webm?t=1787571546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/ab671d3b4ed080f9274d9e6d457290a7.mp4?t=1787571546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth, responsive controls with visceral, hard‑hitting feedback.Grab unique weapon parts and action modules in the levels, customize your mecha to your liking, and take on tough enemies. Mix guns and blades to create your own combos—this might just be the most <i>distinctive </i>mecha action game you've ever played.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>React, Parry, and Punish</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/c99922eb85fc35721c3b66448f037f72.poster.avif?t=1787571546\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/c99922eb85fc35721c3b66448f037f72.webm?t=1787571546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/c99922eb85fc35721c3b66448f037f72.mp4?t=1787571546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/82c85e430f7de5b95a4a8979c087828d.poster.avif?t=1787571546\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/82c85e430f7de5b95a4a8979c087828d.webm?t=1787571546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/82c85e430f7de5b95a4a8979c087828d.mp4?t=1787571546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When facing attacks, dodge and weave, raise your shield to block, or take all of them down? Fight your way, your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various weapons and gear, mix and match freely</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/92d44b676f84e12a302d88b7fcfa0cd1.poster.avif?t=1787571546\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/92d44b676f84e12a302d88b7fcfa0cd1.webm?t=1787571546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/extras/92d44b676f84e12a302d88b7fcfa0cd1.mp4?t=1787571546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely mix and match a range of weapons from heat dagger to heavy howitzers, and use them on different battlefields</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Even more weapon modules are in active development…)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Development Version]</h2>", "short_description": "The Forge is a mech-combat sci-fi action game. Step into the cockpit as mercenary pilot Ivan and fight alongside a mech with a soul—Machine Spirit. Dormant Dragon holds a strange and rare mineral. When wolves come for the ore, you and your mech must choose, and planet's fate hangs in the balance.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/56a3a255a257c43f5c98626b2a9ccff71ce970a2/header.jpg?t=1787571546", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/55a5f23502a2001f34f2c26e3de666ee3e6dbdad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787571546", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4489960/55a5f23502a2001f34f2c26e3de666ee3e6dbdad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787571546", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb